Alembic migrations.

- Create a migration from the models:  just forge "add article model"
- Apply pending migrations:            just migrate-forward
- Roll back to a revision:             just migrate-backward <revision>
- Show the history:                    just showmigrations

Migrations run automatically when the container starts (scripts/entrypoint.sh).
New models must be imported in app/core/models.py to be picked up by autogenerate.
